    "updated_at": "2020-07-16T19:01:27Z",
    "body": "@foolip I'm doing some work in https://github.com/miketaylr/clientInformation-files/issues/1 to classify those samples. So far it seems like `clientInformation` is used by several common libraries for browser detection and fingerprinting. This is not just Window enumeration, but should not \"break\" if `clientInformation` is removed.\r\nWhat are the current guidelines/criteria for feature removal in Chromium?",
